            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal ogow, mid kasta oo maahmaahyo ku maahmaahaaba wuxuu kuugu maahmaahi doonaa maahmaahyadan isagoo leh, Sida ay hooyadu tahay ayaa gabadheeduna tahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad tahay gabadhii hooyadaa oo ninkeeda iyo carruurteedaba nacda, oo weliba waxaad tahay walaashii walaalahaa oo nimankoodii iyo carruurtoodiiba nacay. Hooyadaa waxay ahayd reer Xeed, oo aabbahaana wuxuu ahaa reer Amor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo walaashaada kaa weynuna waa Samaariya, ta iyada iyo gabdhaheeduba bidixdaada deggan yihiin, oo walaashaada kaa yaruna waa Sodom ta iyada iyo gabdhaheeduba midigtaada deggan yihiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jidadkoodii kuma aadan socon oo waxyaalahoodii karaahiyada ahaa oo kalena ma aadan samayn, laakiinse taasu wax yar bay kula noqotay, oo iyaga jidadkaagii oo dhan waad kaga sii darnayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Noloshaydaan ku dhaartaye, Waxa adiga iyo gabdhahaagu aad samayseen oo kale walaashaa Sodom iyo gabdhaheeduba ma ay samayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg, walaashaa Sodom dembigeedu sidan buu ahaa. Iyada iyo gabdhaheeduba waxay lahaayeen kibir, iyo cunto faro badan, iyo raaxo barwaaqo ah, laakiinse masaakiinta iyo saboolka baahan gacmahooda ma ay taageeri jirin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba iyagu way isla madax weynaadeen, oo hortayday karaahiyo ku sameeyeen, sidaas daraaddeed markaan waxaas arkay ayaan fogeeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xataa dembigaaga badhkiis Samaariya ma ay samayn, laakiinse waxyaalahaaga karaahiyada ah waad ka sii badisay kuweeda, oo walaalahaana waxaad xaq kaga dhigtay waxyaalahaagii karaahiyada ahaa oo aad samaysay oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal adigu ceebow, waayo, walaalahaa waad xukuntay, maxaa yeelay, waxaad samaysay wax karaahiyadoodii ka sii daran, oo iyagu way kaa xaq badan yihiin. Haddaba facsharan, oo ceebow, waayo, waxaad xaq ka dhigtay walaalahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan dib u soo celin doonaa maxaabiistoodii, kuwaas oo ah maxaabiistii Sodom iyo gabdhaheeda, iyo maxaabiistii Samaariya iyo gabdhaheeda, iyo maxaabiistaada iyaga dhex jooga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si aad u ceebowdid, oo aad ugu facsharantid wixii aad samaysay oo dhan, waayo, waxaad iyaga u tahay qalbi qabowjis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa walaalahaa Sodom iyo gabdhaheedu ay sidoodii hore ku soo noqon doonaan, oo Samaariya iyo gabdhaheeduna ay sidoodii hore ku soo noqon doonaan, oo adiga iyo gabdhahaaguna aad sidiinnii hore ku soo noqon doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, walaashaa Sodom afkaagu kama hadlin waagii aad kibirsanayd, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "intaan xumaantaada daaha laga qaadin, sidii markii gabdhaha Suuriya iyo inta hareerahooda ku wareegsan oo dhan, iyo xataa gabdhaha reer Falastiin ay ku caayeen iyagoo dhan kastaba kaa quudhsada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Adiga sharkaagii iyo waxyaalahaagii karaahiyada ahaaba waa lagugu ciqaabay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, wuxuu Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay, Waxaan kugu samayn doonaa sidaad samaysay oo kale, waayo, adigu dhaartii waad quudhsatay markaad axdigii jebisay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase ahaatee axdigaygii aan yaraantaadii kula dhigtay waan soo xusuusan doonaa, oo weliba waxaan kula samaysan doonaa axdi weligiis ah. ",
          "type": "text",
